          "guid": "mt3xeswhx3r6d0jy",
          "message": {
            "text": "Every renderer branch is classified at the narrowest sound boundary. Exact generated boxes and Chromium raster rectangles are usable; bounded visual supersets may drive static culling; text, pseudos, arbitrary effects, fragmented reference geometry, split backdrop ownership, and unavailable surfaces stay unknown. The important review invariant is that adding a new paint emitter must either add its geometry here or deliberately retain it.",
            "markdown": "Every renderer branch is classified at the narrowest sound boundary. Exact generated boxes and Chromium raster rectangles are usable; bounded visual supersets may drive static culling; text, pseudos, arbitrary effects, fragmented reference geometry, split backdrop ownership, and unavailable surfaces stay unknown. The important review invariant is that adding a new paint emitter must either add its geometry here or deliberately retain it."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
